{"type":"message","id":"916f8d21","parentId":"46e9e857","timestamp":"2026-03-17T04:02:40.272Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我看到这个文件是在今天 11:26 创建的，所有检查项都是 null。现在时间是 12:02（东八区）。根据 HEARTBEAT.md 的规则，我应该优先检查距离上次最久、且最有价值的项目。\n\n目前所有项目都没有检查过，我需要检查是否有可用的工具来执行这些检查。让我先看看当前可用的工具：\n\n1. **calendar** - 需要检查用户的日历，但我不确定是否有现成的日历工具\n2. **email** - 需要检查邮件，也不确定是否有工具\n3. **mentions** - 需要检查社交媒体提及\n4. **weather** - 有 weather 技能可以用\n\n根据 USER.md，用户的工作时间是 8:00-21:00，现在是 12:02，所以不在不打扰时间段（23:00-08:00）。\n\n不过，我需要考虑几点：\n1. 所有检查项都是 null，说明这是第一次检查\n2. 用户是个人开发者、公众号博主，可能在飞书等平台有日历和邮件\n3. 天气检查相对简单，可以先用天气技能检查\n\n让我尝试检查天气：\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5n38b567iam28zwhwr6zewxm","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/weather/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":21383,"output":296,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21679,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773720142200}}
{"type":"message","id":"24bf71ae","parentId":"916f8d21","timestamp":"2026-03-17T04:02:40.278Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_5n38b567iam28zwhwr6zewxm","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: weather\ndescription: Get current weather and forecasts (no API key required).\nhomepage: https://wttr.in/:help\nmetadata: {\"clawdbot\":{\"emoji\":\"🌤️\",\"requires\":{\"bins\":[\"curl\"]}}}\n---\n\n# Weather\n\nTwo free services, no API keys needed.\n\n## wttr.in (primary)\n\nQuick one-liner:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?format=3\"\n# Output: London: ⛅️ +8°C\n```\n\nCompact format:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?format=%l:+%c+%t+%h+%w\"\n# Output: London: ⛅️ +8°C 71% ↙5km/h\n```\n\nFull forecast:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?T\"\n```\n\nFormat codes: `%c` condition · `%t` temp · `%h` humidity · `%w` wind · `%l` location · `%m` moon\n\nTips:\n- URL-encode spaces: `wttr.in/New+York`\n- Airport codes: `wttr.in/JFK`\n- Units: `?m` (metric) `?u` (USCS)\n- Today only: `?1` · Current only: `?0`\n- PNG: `curl -s \"wttr.in/Berlin.png\" -o /tmp/weather.png`\n\n## Open-Meteo (fallback, JSON)\n\nFree, no key, good for programmatic use:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast?latitude=51.5&longitude=-0.12&current_weather=true\"\n```\n\nFind coordinates for a city, then query. Returns JSON with temp, windspeed, weathercode.\n\nDocs: https://open-meteo.com/en/docs\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773720160275}}
