{"type":"message","id":"4d3f4a94","parentId":"a4dd7555","timestamp":"2026-03-17T04:04:16.982Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_kyvrohj3noibosl199hmec8o","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-03-17\n\n## 今日初始化\n- 初始化 `memory/` 目录\n- 创建 `MEMORY.md` 作为长期记忆文件\n- 计划整理当前工作区并做一次 git 提交\n\n## 今日状态\n- OpenClaw 状态巡检完成：Feishu 渠道正常，当前会话正常\n- 发现工作区存在未跟踪文件与本地状态文件，需要整理\n- OpenClaw 提示有可用更新：npm 2026.3.13\n\n## 待跟进\n- 评估是否升级 OpenClaw\n- 持续沉淀长期记忆与日常记录习惯\n- [x] 补齐 memory 体系：新增 `memory/README.md`、`memory/TEMPLATE.md`、`memory/heartbeat-state.json`\n\n## 决策 / 结论\n- 长期信息写入 `MEMORY.md`，每日过程写入 `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md`\n- heartbeat 检查状态统一记录在 `memory/heartbeat-state.json`\n- heartbeat 默认执行低打扰巡检，无新增信息时直接返回 `HEARTBEAT_OK`\n- “处理一下今天的事”默认可按 `memory/TODAY-SUMMARY-TEMPLATE.md` 输出\n\n## 已完成\n- 新增 `HEARTBEAT.md` 实用巡检规则\n- 新增 `memory/MEMORY-RULES.md`\n- 新增 `memory/TODAY-SUMMARY-TEMPLATE.md`\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773720256979}}
{"type":"message","id":"e807432a","parentId":"4d3f4a94","timestamp":"2026-03-17T04:04:37.601Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"好的，我已经完成了今天的初始化工作。现在我需要更新 heartbeat-state.json 文件，因为这是第一次检查天气，虽然失败了，但我也应该记录下来。\n\n另外，根据 HEARTBEAT.md 的规则，现在是工作时间（12:03），距离上次检查（11:26）已经超过30分钟，所以可以进行检查。\n\n但是，考虑到：\n1. 这是第一次心跳检查\n2. 天气检查失败（网络问题）\n3. 没有发现需要立即提醒的事项\n4. 没有紧急的日历、邮件或提及需要处理\n5. 用户可能正在工作，不希望被打扰\n\n根据\"不打扰条件\"：如果没有任何新增信息，应该优先 `HEARTBEAT_OK`。\n\n让我更新 heartbeat-state.json 文件，记录这次检查：\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fdktuw7lrtshp0mbz0nzjr3h","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/heartbeat-state.json","oldText":"{\n  \"lastChecks\": {\n    \"email\": null,\n    \"calendar\": null,\n    \"weather\": null,\n    \"mentions\": null\n  },\n  \"lastProactiveReachoutAt\": null,\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-03-17T11:26:00+08:00\"\n}","newText":"{\n  \"lastChecks\": {\n    \"email\": null,\n    \"calendar\": null,\n    \"weather\": 1742198580,\n    \"mentions\": null\n  },\n  \"lastProactiveReachoutAt\": null,\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-03-17T12:03:00+08:00\"\n}"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":23524,"output":392,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23916,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773720256981}}
